      <h2>Targeting the right postcodes</h2>
      <p>Exterior cleaning is a local, drive-time business. There's no point paying to show your ad to someone an hour and a half away you'd never travel to. So I target homeowners in the exact areas you cover, the kind of streets with the driveways, render and roofs that turn into real jobs. You tell me how far you'll travel, and the ads stay inside it.</p>

